 "An ellipsis (...) has to follow the digits that repeat after the point, like 0.333...": "省略號（...）必須跟在小數點後迴圈的數字之後，例如 0.333...",
 "Calculus": "微積分",
 "Calculus Engine": "微積分引擎",
 "Engines": "引擎",
 "Derivative": "導數",
 "Integral": "積分",
 "All of calculus in one module: derivatives, integrals, limits, series and curve analysis, for as many expressions and parameters as you like.": "一個模組包含全部微積分：導數、積分、極限、級數和曲線分析，表示式和引數的數量隨你需要。",
 "This module holds a list of expressions (ƒ₁, ƒ₂ …) and a list of named parameters (a, b, c …). Both lists can grow as long as you want. Hover over or select the module and use the + and − buttons to add or remove an expression (the ƒ buttons) or a parameter (the p buttons). Every expression, parameter name and parameter value is a setting with its own pin, like any other setting. The Analysis setting picks the topic. Derivative: exact symbolic derivatives of any order, with respect to x, t or a parameter, with the value at a point and an optional tangent line. Integral: a closed-form antiderivative when one is known, and the definite integral by adaptive Gauss–Kronrod (improper bounds included) or by Simpson, trapezoid or midpoint steps. Limit: two-sided and one-sided limits at a point or at infinity. It tells you when the limit is infinite or doesn’t exist. Series: a sum of terms with its convergence test and estimated value, the Taylor polynomial about any point, or the Fourier series on −L…L. Curve analysis: domain gaps, symmetry, intercepts, local maxima and minima, inflection points, vertical, horizontal and slant asymptotes, where the curve rises, falls and bends, plus the area and arc length over the window. The face is a graph like a Meter’s, with the latest number in the title row. The Equation output carries the functions and their results, so a Meter can draw them. Connect an Equation to the Equation pin and it replaces the typed expressions and the plot range. Expressions that use t are recomputed every tick.": "模組儲存一個表示式列表（ƒ₁、ƒ₂ …）和一個命名引數列表（a、b、c …）。兩個列表都可以無限擴充套件：把滑鼠懸停在模組上或選中模組時出現的 + 和 − 按鈕可新增或刪除表示式（ƒ 按鈕）或引數（p 按鈕），而每個表示式、每個引數名和每個引數值都是一項設定，和其他設定一樣有自己的設定引腳。“分析”設定選擇主題。導數：任意階的精確符號導數，可對 x、t 或某個引數求導，給出某點的值，還可選擇畫出切線。積分：已知時給出閉式原函式，定積分使用自適應高斯–克朗羅德法（含廣義積分的積分限），或辛普森、梯形、中點法。極限：在某點或無窮遠處的雙側和單側極限，極限為無窮或不存在時會明確說明。級數：項的求和及其收斂判別和估計值、任意點處的泰勒多項式，或 −L…L 上的傅立葉級數。曲線分析：定義域缺口、對稱性、截距、極大值和極小值、拐點、垂直、水平和斜漸近線、增減區間和凹凸區間，以及視窗內的面積和弧長。模組表面是類似儀表的圖形，標題行顯示最新的數值；“方程”輸出攜帶函式及其結果，所以儀表可以把它們畫出來。連線到“方程”引腳的方程會替換鍵入的表示式和繪圖範圍。使用 t 的表示式在每個節拍都會重新計算。",
