 "x^3 - 3x with Curve analysis: roots at 0 and ±√3, a maximum at −1, a minimum at 1, an inflection point at 0.": "x^3 - 3x 做曲線分析：零點在 0 和 ±√3，極大值在 −1，極小值在 1，拐點在 0。",
