 "Horizontal asymptotes": "水平漸近線",
 "Improper integral": "廣義積分",
 "Increasing on": "遞增區間",
 "Inflection points": "拐點",
 "Integral over the window": "視窗內的積分",
 "Limit value": "極限值",
 "Function limit": "函式極限",
 "Local maxima": "極大值點",
 "Local minima": "極小值點",
 "Lowest value in the window": "視窗內的最小值",
 "Mean value": "平均值",
 "Not defined on": "無定義的區間",
 "Partial sum of the terms shown": "所示各項的部分和",
 "Polynomial at the point": "多項式在該點的值",
 "Radius of convergence (estimate)": "收斂半徑（估計）",
 "Series": "級數",
 "Series at the point": "級數在該點的值",
 "Highest degree reached": "達到的最高次數",
