 "x-intercepts": "x 軸截距",
 "y-intercept": "y 軸截距",
 "Derivative of higher order": "高階導數",
 "Exact, symbolic": "精確，符號方法",
 "Numerical (no closed form)": "數值方法（無閉式）",
 "(numerical)": "（數值）",
 "(no closed form: computed numerically)": "（無閉式：用數值方法計算）",
 "Adaptive Gauss–Kronrod": "自適應高斯–克朗羅德法",
