 "No place given. Type a city, country or address in the inspector, or connect text to the Place pin.": "沒有給出地點。請在檢查器中輸入城市、國家或地址，或將文本連線到“地點”引腳。",
 "“{q}” isn’t a place the program knows, and other places can only be looked up in a browser.": "“{q}”不是本程式已知的地點，查詢其他地點需要瀏覽器。",
 "Couldn’t find “{q}”. Try the name of a city, country, province or address, or write coordinates like 35.68, 139.76.": "找不到“{q}”。請試試城市、國家、省份或地址的名稱，或輸入 35.68, 139.76 這樣的座標。",
