 "The converted file is gone. Run the program again to make it.": "轉換後的檔案已不存在。請重新執行程式來生成它。",
 "A {from} file can become:": "{from}檔案可以轉換為：",
 "Conversion happens in this browser. Nothing is uploaded, and the result isn’t saved with the program. It’s made again whenever the program runs.": "轉換在此瀏覽器內進行，不會上傳任何內容，結果也不會隨程式儲存：程式執行時會重新生成。",
