 "This browser wouldn’t go full screen.": "此瀏覽器無法進入全屏。",
 "Copied.": "已複製。",
 "Clipboard is blocked here. Select the text and press Ctrl/⌘+C.": "此處剪貼簿被阻止。請選中文字後按 Ctrl/⌘+C。",
 "{n} characters · {l} lines": "{n} 個字元 · {l} 行",
 "Wrap lines": "自動換行",
 "Copy": "複製",
 "Download": "下載",
 "Text": "文本",
 "This text is longer than the Projector can hold, so only the first part is shown.": "這段文字超過投影器能容納的長度，因此只顯示前面一部分。",
 "{r} rows · {c} columns": "{r} 行 · {c} 列",
 "Only the first 1 000 rows are shown. The Text tab has all of them.": "只顯示前 1 000 行。“文本”頁籤裡有全部內容。",
 "Category": "類別",
 "Source code": "原始碼",
 "Preview": "預覽",
 "Table": "表格",
 "Contents": "內容列表",
 "Details": "詳情",
 "View": "檢視",
 "How to show the file": "檔案的顯示方式",
 "{n} files inside": "內含 {n} 個檔案",
 "The file’s bytes aren’t available, so it can’t be played here.": "無法獲得檔案的資料，因此不能在此播放。",
 "This file isn’t in this browser any more. Programs that were shared or imported don’t carry their files, so drop it on its Files node again.": "此檔案已不在這個瀏覽器裡。分享或匯入的程式不會帶上檔案：請重新把它拖到對應的檔案節點上。",
