 "a speed": "速度",
 "Holds {what} as an amount with a unit, such as {ex}, and converts it between units and SI prefixes.": "將{what}儲存為帶單位的數值，例如 {ex}，並可在各單位和 SI 字首之間轉換。",
 "How much of {what}, in the prefix and unit chosen below.": "{what}的數值，使用下方選擇的字首和單位。",
 "The unit of the amount: {list}.": "數值的單位：{list}。",
 "SI prefix, a power of ten placed in front of the unit. Every unit takes all 24 prefixes. “auto” picks the step of 1000 that keeps the amount between 1 and 999.": "SI 字首，即放在單位前面的 10 的冪：每個單位都可使用全部 24 個字首。“auto”會選取使數值保持在 1 到 999 之間的 1000 倍步長。",
 "Free text shown on the workspace. It doesn’t affect how the program runs.": "顯示在工作區上的自由文本。它不影響執行。",
 "Credit shown on the program. It’s just a label, not a verified identity.": "顯示在程式上的署名。它只是一個標籤，並非經過驗證的身份。",
 "None. Long notes wrap and get clipped inside the node. The full text is in the inspector.": "無。較長的備註會換行並在節點內被裁剪；完整文本在檢查器中。",
 "None. This is plain text. It’s not a signature, and it doesn’t prove who made the program.": "無。這只是純文本：它不是簽名，也不能證明程式的作者。",
 "A true value applies the language right away. Connect a switch, a button or a pulse to it.": "收到真值時立即應用語言。可連線開關、按鈕或脈衝。",
 "Code of the language this module is set to: en, zh-Hans or zh-Hant.": "此模組所設語言的程式碼：en、zh-Hans 或 zh-Hant。",
 "The language written in itself, for example 简体中文.": "以該語言自身書寫的語言名稱，例如 簡體中文。",
 "True, as an event, every time the module applies its language to the workspace.": "每當模組把語言應用到工作區時，以事件形式輸出為真。",
 "The interface language the workspace switches to: English, Simplified Chinese (zh-Hans) or Traditional Chinese (zh-Hant).": "工作區要切換到的介面語言：英語、簡體中文 (zh-Hans) 或繁體中文 (zh-Hant)。",
 "Auto switches the language when the program starts and whenever the Language setting changes. Signal waits for a true value on the Apply pin.": "“自動”會在程式啟動時以及“語言”設定更改時切換語言。“訊號”則等待“應用”引腳收到真值。",
 "Remember the language the next time this browser opens the editor. Off: it only lasts for this session.": "下次在此瀏覽器中開啟編輯器時保留該語言。關閉：僅在本次會話中有效。",
 "Show a short message when the language actually switches.": "語言實際切換時顯示一條簡短提示。",
 "In Auto mode, the language is applied when the program starts and again whenever the Language setting (or its pin) changes. In Signal mode, it’s applied each time a true value reaches Apply. It changes the editor, not the program: signals, saved programs and share codes are identical in every language. You can also change the language in Settings on the toolbar.": "在“自動”模式下，語言會在程式啟動時應用，並在“語言”設定（或其引腳）更改時再次應用。在“訊號”模式下，每當有真值到達“應用”時就應用一次。它改變的是編輯器而不是程式：訊號、已儲存的程式和分享程式碼在所有語言下都完全相同。也可以在工具欄的“設定”中選擇語言。",
 "A Language pin that carries an unknown code falls back to English.": "“語言”引腳傳來未知程式碼時，會回退為英語。",
 "Auto, Language = zh-Hant: the editor switches to Traditional Chinese when you press Run.": "自動，語言 = zh-Hant：按下“執行”時，編輯器切換為繁體中文。",
 "Signal mode with a Switch on Apply: flip the switch to change language.": "訊號模式，並在“應用”上連線一個開關：撥動開關即可切換語言。",
