 "via language model": "通過語言模型",
 "How Gosling thinks": "Gosling 的工作方式",
 "Out of the box Gosling runs entirely in this browser: it reads your live workspace and Nicque’s own documentation, and can build for you. Nothing leaves your device.": "開箱即用時，Gosling 完全在此瀏覽器內執行：它讀取你的即時工作區和 Nicque 的文件，並可為你搭建程式。不會向裝置外發送任何內容。",
 "For open-ended questions about anything, you can connect a language model of your choice (any OpenAI-compatible endpoint). Gosling then sends each question plus a compact picture of your workspace to that service, and the model can create and edit modules through Gosling’s tools.": "對於更開放的問題，你可以連線任意相容 OpenAI 的語言模型介面。連線後，Gosling 會將問題和工作區摘要傳送至該服務，模型可通過 Gosling 的工具建立和編輯模組。",
 "Use a language model": "使用語言模型",
 "Endpoint": "介面地址",
 "Model": "模型",
 "API key": "API 金鑰",
 "The key is stored only in this browser’s local storage and is sent only to the endpoint above. If the model can’t be reached, Gosling falls back to its built-in brain.": "金鑰僅儲存在當前瀏覽器的本地儲存中，並且只發送到上述介面。若模型無法訪問，Gosling 會回退到內建引擎。",
 "Clear conversation": "清空對話",
 "{n} modules · {e} wires · {state}": "{n} 個模組 · {e} 條連線 · {state}",
 "running": "執行中",
 "paused": "已暫停",
 "stopped": "已停止",
 "Gosling settings": "Gosling 設定",
 "Close Gosling": "關閉 Gosling",
 "Close (Esc)": "關閉（Esc）",
 "Gosling is thinking": "Gosling 正在思考",
 "Suggestions": "建議",
 "Message Gosling": "向 Gosling 發訊息",
 "Ask anything, or tell me what to build…": "隨便問，或告訴我你想搭建什麼…",
 "Ask about your workspace, or say “add a timer”…": "詢問工作區狀態，或告訴我你想搭建什麼…",
 "Ask about the workspace...": "詢問工作區狀態...",
 "Send": "傳送",
 "Language model: {model}": "語言模型：{model}",
 "Built-in brain · runs in your browser": "內建引擎 · 在瀏覽器中本地執行",
 "Voice": "語音",
 "Listening…": "正在聆聽…",
 "Thinking…": "正在思考…",
 "Speaking… tap to interrupt": "正在朗讀… 點選可打斷",
 "Paused. Tap to talk": "已暫停，點選說話",
 "Turn Gosling’s voice on": "開啟 Gosling 語音",
 "Mute Gosling’s voice": "關閉 Gosling 語音",
 "Gosling’s voice is off": "Gosling 語音已關閉",
 "Back to typing": "返回文字輸入",
 "Just talk. I answer out loud. Tap the orb to stop me or to finish speaking.": "直接說話即可，我會朗讀回覆。點選圓球可打斷我或結束說話。",
 "Read this aloud": "朗讀這條回覆",
 "Talk to Gosling with the microphone button, or tap the waveform for hands-free Voice mode: I listen, answer out loud, and listen again.": "點選麥克風按鈕即可對 Gosling 說話，或點選波形圖示進入自由語音模式：我聽你說、朗讀回覆，再繼續聽。",
 "Read every reply aloud": "朗讀每條回覆",
 "Best available for this language": "當前語言的最佳語音",
 "Hi, I’m Gosling. This is how I sound.": "你好，我是 Gosling，這是我的聲音。",
 "Preview voice": "試聽語音",
 "This browser can’t speak, so replies stay on screen.": "此瀏覽器不支援語音朗讀，回覆將僅顯示在螢幕上。",
 "Speech recognition is done by your browser. Chrome and Edge send the audio to their speech service to turn it into text; Nicque itself sends nothing anywhere.": "語音識別由你的瀏覽器完成。Chrome 與 Edge 會將音訊發往其語音服務以轉為文字；Nicque 本身不會向外傳送任何資料。",
 "End Voice mode": "退出語音模式",
 "Start Voice mode": "開啟語音模式",
 "Voice mode: talk hands-free": "語音模式：自由語音對話",
 "Read replies aloud": "朗讀回覆",
 "Replies are read aloud": "已開啟朗讀回覆",
 "Stop dictating": "停止語音輸入",
 "Dictate with your voice": "語音輸入",
 "Listening… speak now": "正在聆聽… 請說話",
 "Voice input isn’t supported in this browser. Try Chrome, Edge or Safari.": "此瀏覽器不支援語音輸入，請改用 Chrome、Edge 或 Safari。",
 "Microphone access is blocked. Allow it in your browser’s site settings, then try again.": "麥克風許可權被阻止。請在瀏覽器的網站設定中允許，然後重試。",
 "No microphone was found.": "未找到麥克風。",
 "The browser’s speech service couldn’t be reached. Check your connection.": "無法連線瀏覽器的語音服務，請檢查網路。",
 "I didn’t hear anything.": "沒有聽到任何聲音。",
 "Voice input stopped unexpectedly. Try again.": "語音輸入意外中斷，請重試。",
 "The rest is on screen.": "其餘內容請看螢幕。",
